# Unity build by-products: generated il2cpp C++ and Burst debug info, written beside the .aab
# under whatever name the build was given. Also gitignored; listed here because the graph walks
# the disk when `git ls-files` is unavailable.
#
# Written as `name/*`, not `name/` or `name/**`: those two forms match a LITERAL directory name
# only, so a wildcard in them silently matches nothing. This form goes through fnmatch, whose
# `*` crosses slashes.
*_BackUpThisFolder_ButDontShipItWithYourGame/*
*_BurstDebugInformation_DoNotShip/*

# Vendored third-party C#, tracked in git but not ours: Unity's embedded packages and the Google
# Play Games plugin. Together they were about a quarter of the graph's nodes, and their symbols
# answered searches meant for the game's own code.
unity/Packages/*
unity/Assets/GooglePlayGames/*
